      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "引导赛马娘走向成功，确实不是一件简单事。\n但这是值得倾注一生去追求的事业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5e7affd9c800c52f346ab02936b62c5158218ab82dbaafbd252af3f228122fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
