      "uid": "zhcn:c4c838eb16b491faaac4019a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原以为，她是个高贵、难以接近的马娘。\n但看来并非如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbb6b6bcac7bfb5accb0bb2668727c36dbbe947aea9ca99e36f518bf6467bc6",
